      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "description": "Rain Bird 4-VAN is an adjustable spray nozzle for precise watering of lawns, borders and flower beds. The nozzle produces a fan-shaped spray and allows the installer to set the watering arc to suit the shape of the area. The stated radius is 0.9–1.2 m, the available arc is 0–330°, and the recommended operating pressure is 1.0–2.1 bar.\n\nThe VAN range is suitable for smaller zones and close-range watering. HE-VAN models are designed for improved application efficiency when used at the correct pressure and with a suitable layout. The radius can be fine-tuned using the adjustment screw. Always select a nozzle that matches the sprinkler body, required coverage and flow available to the zone.\n\nCompatible with suitable Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 series spray bodies. Actual radius can vary with pressure, nozzle setting and site conditions.",
          "name": "Rain Bird 4-VAN — adjustable spray nozzle",
