      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "description": "Rain Bird R-VAN-24 is a rotary nozzle designed to deliver controlled, water-efficient irrigation for landscaped areas. Multiple rotating streams apply water more slowly than many conventional spray nozzles, helping the soil absorb it and reducing runoff when the system is correctly designed. The stated coverage is 5.2–7.3 m; the watering pattern is 45–270°; recommended operating pressure is 2.1–3.8 bar.\n\nR-VAN nozzles are useful for matching irrigation coverage to the shape of the planting area, including standard arcs and narrow strips. Select the pattern to suit the location and maintain compatible pressure and flow. Use with compatible Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 spray bodies or other approved bodies as specified by the manufacturer.\n\nActual radius and uniformity depend on pressure, spacing, soil and wind conditions.",
